# Zero-Config Environment Setup for Chat-with-your-CSV
# The system automatically detects keys and activates the dual-backend failover pipeline:
# 1. Groq (Primary: openai/gpt-oss-120b -> Fallback: openai/gpt-oss-20b)
# 2. Google Gemini (Backup: gemini-3.8-flash -> Fallback: gemini-flash-latest)

# Groq API Key (Primary Engine - Get free key at https://console.groq.com/keys)
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# Google Gemini API Key (Backup Engine - Get free key at https://aistudio.google.com/)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
